        <li><strong>CRAFT: Exploiting Precharge Cost Asymmetry for Adaptive DRAM Row Buffer Management.</strong><br /><u>Xu Han</u>, Ziyang Liu, Weitong Wang, Yuyangheng Wang, and Fuxin Zhang. <em>APPT 2026</em>，已录用。</li>
        <li><strong>CoVE: Estimating Value-Predictor Coverage from Workload Entropy.</strong><br />Ziyang Liu, <u>Xu Han</u>, Junyu Yue, Chongxi Wang, and Fuxin Zhang. <em>ICCD 2026</em>，已录用。</li>
        <li><strong>PSqueue: An Enhanced Memory Scheduling Queue Architecture for Multi-Threaded Streaming Memory Access.</strong><br /><u>Xu Han</u>, Weitong Wang, Yuyangheng Wang, and Huandong Wang. <em>HPCC 2024</em>。</li>
